OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'scared to turn heating on'
OL,4,Adue to oil cost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has said she is frightened to
OL,7,Fput her heating on because the cost of
OL,8,Fdomestic oil has nearly doubled.
OL,10,FRoslynn Garner-Gatley, 76, lives in a
OL,11,Fthree-bedroom semi-detached cottage in
OL,12,FYealmpton, south Devon, with no gas
OL,13,Fsupply and relies entirely on oil for
OL,14,Fheating and hot water.
OL,16,FShe said her oil tank held 1,000 litres
OL,17,F(220 gallons). About six months
OL,18,Fearlier, she bought 500 litres (110
OL,19,Fgallons) for #317 plus VAT but, when
OL,20,Fshe contacted her supplier for a
OL,21,Fcurrent quote, she was told the same
OL,22,Famount would cost #600 plus VAT.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
