OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'scared to turn heating on'
OL,4,Adue to oil cost
OL,5,
OL,6,FGarner-Gatley said: "I did not expect
OL,7,Fat my age after working for 50 years to
OL,8,Fbe in a situation where I am terrified
OL,9,Fof putting on the heating because of
OL,10,Fthe price of it."
